{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Fix pushed for review as Gerrit change 1384: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1384\n\nApproach (operator-approved options a + c):\n- (a) Token moved OUT of the URL: both /webhook and /rerun now read the secret from the X-Rebar-Token HTTP header (preferred), which uvicorn's access log does not record. Legacy ?token= query param still accepted for backward-compat until Gerrit's webhooks.config is re-pushed. webhooks.config updated to send the token via 'header = X-Rebar-Token: __BOT_TOKEN__' instead of the URL.\n- (c) Belt-and-suspenders: install_access_log_redaction() attaches TokenRedactingFilter to the uvicorn.access logger, scrubbing token=<value> from any request line before stderr/journald while preserving route + status for observability greps.\n- Runbook infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md /rerun recipe rewritten to use -H 'X-Rebar-Token' (no URL token) with a rotation note.\n\nFiles changed: src/rebar/review_bot/app.py, src/rebar/review_bot/config.py, tests/unit/test_review_bot_token_redaction.py (new), infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md, infra/gerrit/webhooks.config.\n\nTests: 7 new (redaction filter scrubs sentinel query token while keeping route/status; header-authed /rerun logs no sentinel; header auth works for both endpoints; missing/wrong tokens still 401; query backward-compat still authenticates). Full review-bot suite 136 passed. make lint + make typecheck clean. Both endpoints keep the token out of the request line via the header; redaction filter installed as backstop.\n\nREMINDER: this code fix MUST LAND (Verified +1, merged) BEFORE the operator rotates GERRIT_BOT_TOKEN -- otherwise the newly rotated token is logged the moment it is first used through any legacy query-string caller. Rotation is operator-owned and tracked separately. Not closing this ticket: closing needs Verified +1 (green CI) and the rotation must follow the merge."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785867987496710001,"uuid":"d5883dc5-5497-42cf-a72c-296be13398de"}